        "TileImage": "$($repository becd1e10-9b11-4e8a-bd5a-77ebca557c98).Image",
        "Description": "Your target is Xavier Jonstice, a waiter currently operating under a false alias. He is an assassin, going to high class events around the world poisoning the drinks or food of his targets. Due to the money he recieves, he is able to apply for any waiting job and will be hired due to his ever growing resume at prestige events. Xavier thus considers himself unstoppable and buys tons of fake identities when recognised. Our client recently spotted Xavier at a party in Marrakesh and wants closure.",
